### Test Module - Dragonball Servlet - Get all users
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house-testmodule/api/{{apiVersion}}/servlet/test-module/dragonball/users
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### Test Module - Dragonball Servlet - Get user by username
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house-testmodule/api/{{apiVersion}}/servlet/test-module/dragonball/users?username=goku
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### Test Module - Dragonball Servlet - Create user
POST {{SERVER}}/kame-house-testmodule/api/{{apiVersion}}/servlet/test-module/dragonball/users?username={{$randomUserName}}&email={{$randomEmail}}&age={{$randomInt}}&powerLevel={{$randomInt}}&stamina={{$randomInt}}
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### Test Module - Dragonball Servlet - Update user
PUT {{SERVER}}/kame-house-testmodule/api/{{apiVersion}}/servlet/test-module/dragonball/users?id={{id}}&username={{$randomUserName}}&email={{$randomEmail}}&age={{$randomInt}}&powerLevel={{$randomInt}}&stamina={{$randomInt}}
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### Test Module - Dragonball Servlet - Delete user
DELETE {{SERVER}}/kame-house-testmodule/api/{{apiVersion}}/servlet/test-module/dragonball/users?id={{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### Test Module - Dragonball Servlet - Create user manual
POST {{SERVER}}/kame-house-testmodule/api/{{apiVersion}}/servlet/test-module/dragonball/users?username={{$randomUserName}}&email=goku@dbz.com&age={{$randomInt}}&powerLevel={{$randomInt}}&stamina={{$randomInt}}
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}


